stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> LocalOnly : file created locally
    [*] --> NotDownloaded : file uploaded<br/>from another client

    LocalOnly --> Uploading : upload started
    Uploading --> Synced : upload succeeded

    NotDownloaded --> Downloading : download started
    Downloading --> Synced : download succeeded

    Synced --> ModifiedLocally : FSEvents: local change
    Synced --> ModifiedRemotely : diff: server version increased

    ModifiedLocally --> Uploading : next sync<br/>(remote version unchanged)
    ModifiedRemotely --> Downloading : next sync<br/>(local version unchanged)

    ModifiedLocally --> Conflict : both sides<br/>changed simultaneously
    ModifiedRemotely --> Conflict : both sides<br/>changed simultaneously

    Conflict --> Synced : user chose<br/>keep local / remote / both

    Synced --> Deleted : file deletion
    Deleted --> [*]
